<title>MEXICO: Santander keeps Pepsi-Gemex as &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>Santander keeps Pepsi-Gemex as &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santander Investment in Mexico said on Tuesday that Santander maintained its &quot;buy&quot; rating for Mexican bottler Pepsi-Gemex.</p>
<p>The clarification of the rating follows Santander's publication of a report in Spanish earlier in the day that erroneously translated the &quot;buy&quot; recommendation on the firm as &quot;accumulate&quot;.</p>
<p>&quot;We maintain our buy recommendation on Pepsi-Gemex,&quot; a Santander Mexico official said.</p>
<p>Santander initiated coverage of the company in New York on March 11. It stressed on Tuesday that there was no change in its rating of the company.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728 7905))</p>
